{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47732","headline":"上昇歌 · 吴涵虚","name":"上昇歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉皇有诏登仙职，龙吐云兮凤着力。\n眼前蓦地见楼台，异草奇花不可识。\n我向大罗观世界，世界即如指掌大。\n当时不爲上昇忙，一时提向瀛洲卖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴涵虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}